{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"7d1c8a2f4e6b9035","type":"text","text":"# 面板数据：Pooled OLS、固定效应与随机效应\n\n先分清数据结构和模型对象，再分别进入 pooled、FE、RE 与动态路线；定义、放行条件、等价和边界各占一个节点。箭头写明关系，颜色只区分语义角色，不表示掌握程度。","x":0,"y":-480,"width":2640,"height":170,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"54e803c61fab7d92","type":"text","text":"## 复用：[[OLS一致性条件]]\n总体正交、可逆二阶矩与样本矩收敛仍是 pooled 斜率的一般基础。","x":880,"y":-220,"width":360,"height":140},
    {"id":"aa14b001cafe0001","type":"text","text":"## [[非平衡面板]]\n不同单位拥有不同的观测数 $T_i$；这首先是数据结构。","x":1760,"y":-220,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"4"},
    {"id":"21b5d0f38c7e4a69","type":"text","text":"## [[非平衡面板选择|面板样本选择]]\n不平衡本身不致偏；与冲击相关的进入、退出或缺失才会选择样本。","x":2200,"y":-220,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"10a4c9e27b6d3f58","type":"text","text":"## [[面板误差分解]]\n$y_{it}=\\alpha+x_{it}'\\beta+c_i+\\lambda_t+u_{it}$；先区分单位、时期与单位时期冲击。","x":0,"y":0,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"4"},
    {"id":"32c6e1a49d8f5b70","type":"text","text":"## [[面板Pooled OLS]]\n把所有单位时期观测堆叠，并把 $c_i+u_{it}$ 作为复合误差。","x":440,"y":0,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"aa14b003cafe0003","type":"text","text":"## [[Pooled OLS正交条件|Pooled OLS 正交条件]]\n斜率一致性要求回归量与复合误差总体正交。","x":880,"y":0,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"43d7f2b50e9a6c81","type":"text","text":"## 复用：[[遗漏变量偏差]]\n稳定单位效应与 $X$ 相关时，pooled OLS 继承通用遗漏变量机制。","x":1320,"y":0,"width":360,"height":220},
    {"id":"aa14b002cafe0002","type":"text","text":"## [[非平衡面板均值]]\n所有单位均值先锁定同一完整估计样本，再按各单位实际 $T_i$ 期计算。","x":1760,"y":0,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"4"},
    {"id":"760a25e831cd9fb4","type":"text","text":"## [[个体固定效应]]\n把单位特有的时间不变加性成分作为可与 $X_i$ 相关的单位参数。","x":0,"y":340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"65f914d720bc8ea3","type":"text","text":"## [[组内变换]]\n在共同估计样本中减去单位均值，精确消去加性 $c_i$。","x":440,"y":340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"871b36f942dea0c5","type":"text","text":"## [[固定效应严格外生]]\n每期冲击通常须对过去、当期和未来的整条回归量路径外生。","x":880,"y":340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"982c470a53efb1d6","type":"text","text":"## [[组内变异边界]]\n时间不变或单期单位不提供 within 信息；弱变化只给出很少信号。","x":1320,"y":340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"a93d581b64f0c2e7","type":"text","text":"## [[时间固定效应]]\n时期 indicators 表示每期对所有单位共同的加性冲击。","x":1760,"y":340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"ba4e692c7501d3f8","type":"text","text":"## 复用：[[错位 DID 的已处理对照]]\n单位 FE + 时间 FE 不会自动修复错位处理与异质效应。","x":2200,"y":340,"width":340,"height":220},
    {"id":"aa14b005cafe0005","type":"text","text":"## [[固定效应因果边界|个体 FE 因果边界]]\n消去加性不变单位成分不会自动建立可信反事实。","x":0,"y":680,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"aa14b004cafe0004","type":"text","text":"## [[Within与LSDV等价|Within 与 LSDV 等价]]\n同样本同规格下，二者只对共同斜率数值等价。","x":440,"y":680,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"aa14b006cafe0006","type":"text","text":"## [[动态面板模型|动态面板]]\n把滞后结果放入回归以表示状态持续性。","x":880,"y":680,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"0f93be71ca56284d","type":"text","text":"## [[动态固定效应偏误]]\n短 $T$ 下，去均值滞后结果与去均值误差相关，产生 Nickell 偏误。","x":1320,"y":680,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"aa14b007cafe0007","type":"text","text":"## [[随机效应]]\n把 $c_i$ 作为单位层随机误差分量，并在正交限制下保留 within 与 between 信息。","x":0,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"cb5f7a3d8612e409","type":"text","text":"## [[随机效应正交假设]]\n标准 RE 需要 $E(c_i\\mid X_i)=0$；随机抽样不能替代这项限制。","x":440,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"ed719c5fa834062b","type":"text","text":"## [[相关随机效应]]\n用共同样本中的回归量单位均值参数化 $c_i$ 与 $X_i$ 的相关部分。","x":880,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"aa14b00acafe0010","type":"text","text":"## [[Mundlak检验|Mundlak 检验]]\n在 CRE 中联合检验单位均值项 $\\pi=0$。","x":1320,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"aa14b00bcafe0011","type":"text","text":"## [[Hausman检验|Hausman 检验]]\n比较同一参数的两个估计量是否系统分离。","x":1760,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"fe82ad60b945173c","type":"text","text":"## [[Hausman检验边界|Hausman 检验边界]]\n只比较同样本、共同参数与相容规格；不拒绝不证明 RE。","x":2200,"y":1020,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"dc608b4e9723f51a","type":"text","text":"## [[随机效应GLS|随机效应 GLS]]\n按 $T_i$ 与随机截距协方差结构准去均值，结合 within 与 between 信息。","x":440,"y":1340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"aa14b008cafe0008","type":"text","text":"## [[CRE与FE斜率等价|CRE 与 FE 斜率等价]]\n同一样本与线性规格下，时变回归量斜率数值相同。","x":880,"y":1340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"aa14b009cafe0009","type":"text","text":"## [[CRE时间不变系数边界|CRE 时间不变系数边界]]\n能报告时间不变变量的系数，不等于识别其因果效应。","x":1320,"y":1340,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"1a04cf82db67395e","type":"text","text":"## 二元结果进入另一条面板分支\n\n静态条件 Logit 与一般非线性固定效应 MLE 面对的是条件化和附带参数问题；它们不是 Nickell 偏误的延伸。","x":1760,"y":1680,"width":430,"height":220,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"2b15d093ec784b60","type":"text","text":"## [[条件固定效应Logit|条件固定效应 Logit]]\n联合静态 Logit 条件似然成立时，按单位成功次数条件化可消去单位截距。","x":1760,"y":2020,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"3c26e1a49d8f5c81","type":"text","text":"## [[非线性固定效应偏误]]\n一般非线性面板在短 $T$ 下逐单位估计固定效应，会把单位参数估计误差传入共同斜率。","x":2240,"y":2020,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"4d37f2b50e9a6c92","type":"text","text":"## [[条件Logit只用变化组|条件 Logit 只用变化组]]\n共同斜率只由结果发生变化的组识别；全 0 或全 1 组不参与斜率。","x":1760,"y":2340,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"1"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"id":"e000000000000001","fromNode":"aa14b001cafe0001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b002cafe0002","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"不同 $T_i$ 下按共同完整样本的实际时期求均值"},
    {"id":"e000000000000002","fromNode":"aa14b001cafe0001","fromSide":"right","toNode":"21b5d0f38c7e4a69","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"结构不平衡本身不等于选择偏误"},
    {"id":"e000000000000003","fromNode":"10a4c9e27b6d3f58","fromSide":"right","toNode":"32c6e1a49d8f5b70","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"把 $c_i+u_{it}$ 合并为复合误差并堆叠估计"},
    {"id":"e000000000000004","fromNode":"54e803c61fab7d92","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b003cafe0003","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"把通用 OLS 矩条件具体化到 $v_{it}=c_i+u_{it}$"},
    {"id":"e000000000000005","fromNode":"32c6e1a49d8f5b70","fromSide":"right","toNode":"aa14b003cafe0003","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"斜率一致性须检查复合误差总体正交"},
    {"id":"e000000000000006","fromNode":"aa14b003cafe0003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"43d7f2b50e9a6c81","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"$c_i$ 与 $X_i$ 相关时正交失败，形成遗漏变量路径"},
    {"id":"e000000000000007","fromNode":"10a4c9e27b6d3f58","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"760a25e831cd9fb4","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"把 $c_i$ 作为可与 $X_i$ 相关的单位参数"},
    {"id":"e000000000000008","fromNode":"760a25e831cd9fb4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"65f914d720bc8ea3","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"用单位去均值控制这些单位截距"},
    {"id":"e000000000000009","fromNode":"760a25e831cd9fb4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b005cafe0005","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"消去加性不变成分不等于建立因果反事实"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000a","fromNode":"65f914d720bc8ea3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b004cafe0004","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"同样本同规格下仅共同斜率数值等价"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000b","fromNode":"65f914d720bc8ea3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"871b36f942dea0c5","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"消去 $c_i$ 后仍需整条回归量路径外生"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000c","fromNode":"871b36f942dea0c5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"982c470a53efb1d6","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"矩条件之外还需可用的单位内变异"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000d","fromNode":"871b36f942dea0c5","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b006cafe0006","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"滞后结果使静态严格外生通常机械失效"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000e","fromNode":"aa14b006cafe0006","fromSide":"right","toNode":"0f93be71ca56284d","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"短 $T$ 下 within 使滞后结果与变换误差相关"},
    {"id":"e00000000000000f","fromNode":"982c470a53efb1d6","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a93d581b64f0c2e7","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"若有共同时间冲击，可加入时间 FE"},
    {"id":"e000000000000010","fromNode":"a93d581b64f0c2e7","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ba4e692c7501d3f8","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"共同时间截距不修复错位处理的已处理对照"},
    {"id":"e000000000000011","fromNode":"aa14b007cafe0007","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cb5f7a3d8612e409","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"标准 RE 保留 between 信息需 $E(c_i\\mid X_i)=0$"},
    {"id":"e000000000000012","fromNode":"cb5f7a3d8612e409","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"dc608b4e9723f51a","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"正交与随机截距协方差结构支持准去均值 GLS"},
    {"id":"e000000000000013","fromNode":"cb5f7a3d8612e409","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ed719c5fa834062b","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"若放松完全正交，用单位均值参数化 $c_i$–$X_i$ 相关"},
    {"id":"e000000000000014","fromNode":"ed719c5fa834062b","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b008cafe0008","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"同样本同线性规格下时变斜率与 within FE 等价"},
    {"id":"e000000000000015","fromNode":"ed719c5fa834062b","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"aa14b009cafe0009","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"可报告时间不变系数不等于获得其因果识别"},
    {"id":"e000000000000016","fromNode":"ed719c5fa834062b","fromSide":"right","toNode":"aa14b00acafe0010","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"联合检验单位均值项 $\\pi=0$"},
    {"id":"e000000000000017","fromNode":"aa14b00acafe0010","fromSide":"right","toNode":"aa14b00bcafe0011","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"对照：增广回归检验 vs 估计量差分"},
    {"id":"e000000000000018","fromNode":"aa14b00bcafe0011","fromSide":"right","toNode":"fe82ad60b945173c","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"共同参数与相容规格才可比"},
    {"id":"e000000000000019","fromNode":"1a04cf82db67395e","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"2b15d093ec784b60","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"静态联合 Logit 可按单位成功次数条件化"},
    {"id":"e00000000000001a","fromNode":"1a04cf82db67395e","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"3c26e1a49d8f5c81","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"一般短 $T$ 非线性 FE 逐单位估计截距"},
    {"id":"e00000000000001b","fromNode":"2b15d093ec784b60","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"4d37f2b50e9a6c92","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"共同斜率只由结果发生变化的单位识别"}
  ]
}
